From #18 review (I2): the fronting tier polls GET /skeid/registry/snapshot with the downstream admin key, which is write-capable (all admin routes). Add a dedicated read-only scope/credential (e.g. SKEID_REGISTRY_READ_KEY or key scope "registry:read") that only authorizes the snapshot route; admin key keeps working for compat. Update ADR 0017.
